+{"id":"fabro-7f27","title":"Revisor intake: require a body on filed seeds — title-only seeds lose acceptance detail","status":"open","type":"task","priority":2,"createdAt":"2026-09-11T22:17:04.254Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-11T22:17:04.254Z","description":"fabro-3ef7 was title-only; the planner authored six acceptance criteria from the title plus tree probes, so the reviewer judged planner-derived criteria rather than a user spec — combined with the evidence mislabel, the run was one ambiguous criterion away from review ping-pong ($2.00 / 26.8 min of implementer work rode on it). Change: intake lint in the revisor workflow that rejects/flags body-less seeds, plus backfill of legacy title-only seeds. Basis: run 01M294HH117ZMV11HCNCEQPCDJ, workflow version e825d8c827ce15defe0aa57d3586b0f369cab48cc7fe711d526776762f442aa1, commit 1caf1ee66bbf5a8e5a73b66446720cf20a3768ea","labels":["revision"]}
